---
// Below-xl hero background: the kanban board behind the headline.
//
// The board is drawn in a 400x900 coordinate space that covers the hero like
// `preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice"`. Each column is its own small <svg>
// layer, placed with container units so it lines up exactly with that space:
// --u is the px size of one board unit, and a layer at board box (x, y, w, h)
// sits at the matching screen position. Moving a whole layer is then a pure
// compositor transform; moving groups inside one big SVG would repaint it
// every frame.
//
// Motion (see scripts/heroMotion.ts):
// - default "loop" mode: columns drift slowly, a ticket ships to Done
// - "gyro" mode (Android etc.): columns shift with device tilt at different
//   depths; the ticket keeps shipping
---

